OL,3,GNEWSAAll you need to know about the
OL,4,ALeeds Abbey Dash 2026
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Leeds Abbey Dash road race takes
OL,7,Fplace on Sunday, and this year it has a
OL,8,Frecord 16,000 people taking part.
OL,10,FThe 10k event has been selected as the
OL,11,FEngland Athletics 10k Championship race
OL,12,Ffor 2026, meaning it attracts elite as
OL,13,Fwell as recreational runners.
OL,15,FThe route is known for being fast and
OL,16,Fflat, making it a popular race for
OL,17,Fthose looking for their personal best
OL,18,Fas well as those competing for fun or
OL,19,Fto raise money for their favourite
OL,20,Fcharity.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
